  "placementWhy": "Free similarity fit on 11 cenote pools of OSM (traced from the satellite imagery) matched to the map's blue cenotes by shape and pattern: Gemini's arc and pool, Luna, the arc east of it, the long N-S pool with its east arm, the pool chain south-west of Yax Chen, and Yax Chen's own pool (Cenote Encantado on OSM). 6.57 m/px, rotated 6.3 degrees: the scale bar is not used - its kilometre (128 px) and mile (208 px) agree with each other but give 7.8 m/px, 19% off every pair of pools; the north arrow is about 6 degrees off.",
  "symbols": {
    "why": "A 541 px web overview: no depths, letters, bones, 'To ...' leads, place names or flow arrows are drawn (OCR read only the title, legend and scale text). Kept: the three red 'drop points' of the legend, as place names, and the entrances (the yellow entry point and the blue cenotes).",
